				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-09-06T11:29:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>α版用の説明人間

0：市長名</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-09-06T11:29:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
